# Generated assets under public/assets are committed, not ignored. `npm run assets`
# rebuilds them from Wikimedia Commons (see the README for provenance), but the
# deployed site serves them at runtime and src/data/products.ts imports
# products/credits.json at compile time — so a checkout without them cannot build.
# Re-run the scripts and commit the result when the catalogue changes.

